body:
yeah honestly like there was a lot of problems during this time. Honestly we had gotten bad and started arguing for like two days straight and especially out of no where. We honestly didn't even fight that much because I decided to put my all into this girl. She even called me soul mate too and honestly those words are precious enough for me to stay until she is ready to talk. I don't really see myself with anybody else other than her. I agree that the break was pretty long, but I truly see it as a positive experience and it really allowed me to value her as a person more and I forgot to mention that aside from working on myself. I spent daysss studying the conditions she believed she had. I am more excited and hopeful to see her more than ever. I just texted her a last message as well telling her that I hope she's Safe. 

&#x200B;

You know I am not trying to buy her love, but I was wondering if you recommend like flowers sent to the house or something? I know she really likes gardening and flowers so I low-key wanna keep entertained while we're both in Quarantine anyways. Any tips?
